        s_options     TYPE z2ui5_if_ui5_llm=>ty_s_options
      RETURNING
        VALUE(result) TYPE string
      RAISING
        z2ui5_cx_ui5_llm.

    CLASS-METHODS message_push
      IMPORTING
        io_body TYPE REF TO z2ui5_if_ui5_ajs
        role    TYPE string
        content TYPE string
      RAISING
        z2ui5_cx_ui5_ajs_error.

    CLASS-METHODS map_stop_reason
      IMPORTING
        val           TYPE string
      RETURNING
        VALUE(result) TYPE string.

ENDCLASS.
